#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:2
msgid "Catalog Items |advanced-plus|"
msgstr "Réseau non géré - Configuration par défaut"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Service Catalog is an Advanced+ feature, available in HPE Morpheus "
"Enterprise and Advanced tiers."
msgstr "En mode Unmanaged, Morpheus crée une configuration minimale : un pool de ressources par défaut et un réseau non géré par défaut. Le réseau par défaut est non étiqueté et utilise DHCP."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Self Service catalog (|LibBluCat|) is where administrators can create"
" easily-deployable items for consumption by users operating under the "
"\"Service Catalog\" Persona in |morpheus|. Catalog items can be fully-"
"configured |morpheus| Instances or Blueprints, complete with user input "
"through |morpheus| Inputs, automation Workflows, and more. The catalog "
"items are presented in a simplified interface for ease of deployment "
"without sacrificing configurability for administrators. All available "
"catalog items are built in the Self Service area and users will see "
"relevant items in their catalogs based on Role permissions."
msgstr "Assurez-vous qu'un serveur DHCP existe et que le réseau est configuré pour un VLAN non étiqueté."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:11
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:27
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:60
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:251
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:297
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:311
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Cela permet aux instances de démarrer avec une connectivité sans configuration réseau supplémentaire."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:11
msgid ""
"For more on Personas and using the Service Catalog persona, see the "
"Personas sections of our documentation."
msgstr "Réseau non géré - VLAN supplémentaires"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:13
msgid ""
"Access is granted to the Self Service section through the Library: "
"Catalog Items Role permission. Users with Read rights can view the "
"catalog while users with full rights can create and edit catalog items. "
"Users without any rights to Self Service will not be able to access the "
"page at all."
msgstr "Les utilisateurs peuvent créer des VLAN/réseaux supplémentaires selon les besoins."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:15
msgid ""
"Additionally, a user's Role determines access to the standard and/or "
"service catalog persona and which service catalog items are available for"
" a user under the service catalog persona. See the Roles section of "
"|morpheus| documentation for more information on administering Roles."
msgstr "Vérifiez la configuration VLAN et la disponibilité dans les options de provisionnement."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:18
msgid "Viewing the Self Service Catalog"
msgstr "Des réseaux supplémentaires peuvent être consommés par les instances bare metal."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:20
msgid ""
"The complete Self Service catalog can be viewed by clicking on Catalog "
"from the Provisioning menu. The complete list of items available for the "
"Self Service catalog are shown here but users working in the Service "
"Catalog Persona will see only those allowed based on their user role. In "
"addition to the name and type of each catalog item, we can also see a "
"description and whether not the catalog item is featured or active. "
"Featured items are given special visibility in the Service Catalog "
"Persona and inactive items will not appear as provisioning options."
msgstr "Réseau géré - Intégration ArubaCX"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:22
msgid ".. image:: /images/tools/self_service/catalogList.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:25
msgid "Building Catalog Instances"
msgstr "Confirmez que le plug-in ArubaCX est chargé dans Morpheus."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:27
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:60
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:251
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:311
msgid ""
"API usage for Catalog Items with Forms is not yet supported. If planning "
"to use the API or CLI to order Catalog Items you should not use Forms on "
"Catalog Items until it is supported."
msgstr "Les réseaux gérés permettent à Morpheus de configurer automatiquement les VLAN sur les commutateurs."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:29
msgid ""
"An Instance in |morpheus| is a set of one or more containers or virtual "
"machines that correlate to a single, horizontally-scalable entity or "
"service suite. From the Self Service section, we can pre-configure "
"|morpheus| Instances and present them to users viewing the Service "
"Catalog Persona for one-click deployment."
msgstr "Ajout du plug-in HPE ArubaCX"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:31
msgid ""
"From the Catalog Items List Page (|LibBluCat|), click :guilabel:`ADD`. "
"From the dropdown menu, select Instance. The modal window will appear to "
"configure and add a new catalog Instance."
msgstr "Le plug-in doit être chargé pour activer les fonctionnalités réseau gérées. Suivez la procédure Adding HPE BMaaS Integration pour charger le fichier JAR du plug-in."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:33
msgid ".. image:: /images/tools/self_service/createInstance.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:35
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:257
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:315
msgid "Configure the following:"
msgstr "Requis avant de créer des intégrations réseau."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:37
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:259
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:317
msgid "**NAME:** A friendly name for the catalog item in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Création d'une intégration réseau ArubaCX"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:38
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:260
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:318
msgid ""
"**CODE:** An optional shortcode for coded naming schemes or programmatic "
"reference"
msgstr "L'intégration définit les identifiants des commutateurs et les paires de commutateurs (généralement 2 par rack)."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:39
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:261
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:319
msgid "**DESCRIPTION:** An optional description identifying the catalog item"
msgstr "Vérifiez que les IP, le nom d'utilisateur et le mot de passe des commutateurs sont corrects."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:40
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:262
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:320
msgid ""
"**CATEGORY:** Select an existing category or enter a new one. When "
"provisioning from the catelog, items can be filtered by category"
msgstr "Une intégration est nécessaire par rack (paire de commutateurs)."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:41
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:264
msgid ""
"**ENABLED:** When checked, this catalog item will be available for "
"provisioning"
msgstr "Création de réseaux gérés"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:42
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:263
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:321
msgid ""
"**LABELS:** A comma-separated list of descriptive strings which can be "
"used to categorize the Catalog Item. The Catalog Items list view page can"
" be filtered by labels to make them easier to find"
msgstr "Les réseaux représentent des VLAN et incluent des attributs tels que le sous-réseau, la passerelle, le DNS et la méthode d'allocation IP."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:43
msgid ""
"**ENABLED:** When marked, this Catalog Item will be available from the "
"provisioning Catalog view"
msgstr "Assurez-vous que l'ID VLAN, les trunks et le sous-réseau sont corrects."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:44
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:265
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:323
msgid ""
"**DISABLE AUTO PRICE:** When marked, price estimates are no longer "
"refreshed with every field change at the time this Catalog Item is "
"ordered. For some workloads with heavy Configuration-phase Tasks this may"
" improve performance of the order page"
msgstr "Le VLAN principal est non étiqueté, les trunks VLAN sont étiquetés."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:45
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:266
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:324
msgid ""
"**FEATURED:** When checked, this catalog item will be given special "
"visibility in the Service Catalog Persona view"
msgstr "Option réseau privé"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:46
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:267
msgid ""
"**ALLOW QUANTITY:** When checked, an additional field is added to the "
"order page allowing users to order multiple copies. If this option is "
"enabled, ensure your configuration supports that flexibility (such as "
"when IP or load balancer details are specified)"
msgstr "Les réseaux privés ne configurent pas de VLAN principal sur l'uplink, les rendant inaccessibles depuis l'extérieur du cloud."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:47
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:268
msgid ""
"**MAX QUANTITY:** When the ALLOW QUANTITY configuration is used, an "
"additional MAX QUANTITY configuration is available which sets an upper "
"limit on the quantity that may be executed"
msgstr "Confirmez si le réseau doit être privé ou public."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:48
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:269
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:325
msgid ""
"**VISIBILITY:** Set to private to keep the catalog item available only to"
" users in the current Tenant. Master Tenant administrators may set "
"catalog items to public to make them viewable and usable by Subtenant "
"users"
msgstr "Utilisé uniquement pour les réseaux de charges de travail internes."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:49
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:270
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:326
msgid "**LOGO:** Select or upload a logo to be associated with this catalog item"
msgstr "Consommation réseau lors du provisionnement"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:50
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:271
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:327
msgid ""
"**DARK LOGO:** If desired, set an alternate logo for use when the dark "
"theme is applied to the |morpheus| appliance"
msgstr "Les réseaux sont attachés aux interfaces physiques ou bondées. Le VLAN principal est non étiqueté, les VLAN trunk sont étiquetés."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:51
msgid ""
"**CONFIG:** Enter, view, or edit Instance config here. Click "
":guilabel:`CONFIGURE` to build a base configuration through the "
"|morpheus| Instance wizard. After configuration through the Instance "
"wizard, you may need to overwrite some static values in the Instance JSON"
" body with calls to custom Input values. This allows your users to easily"
" set the Instance Plan, Group, name, tags, or anything else they may need"
" to control. Dynamic inputs are passed with the following syntax: \"<%= "
"customOptions.fieldName %>\" where fieldName is the Field Name value set "
"on the Input"
msgstr "Vérifiez le type d'interface (physique ou bond) et l'attribution VLAN correcte."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:52
msgid ""
"**CONTENT:** Optionally include documentation content for this Catalog "
"Item. Markdown-formatted text is accepted and displayed appropriately "
"when the item is ordered from the Service Catalog. A new Catalog Item-"
"type Wiki entry will also be added containing this information"
msgstr "Prend en charge Static Bond, LACP Bond et Switch Independent Bond."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:53
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:299
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:332
msgid ""
"**FORM TYPE:** Choose whether a Form or individual Inputs should be used "
"to set the user options at provisioning time. See `Forms documentation "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/library/options/options.html#forms>`_"
" for complete details on creating Forms."
msgstr "Configuration des interfaces bond"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:54
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:300
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:333
msgid ""
"**FORM:** If the Form Type of \"Form\" is selected, choose the pre-"
"existing Form which should be associated with the Catalog Item"
msgstr "Les interfaces bond nécessitent deux ports physiques pour former un lien agrégé."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:55
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:301
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:334
msgid ""
"**INPUTS:** If the Form Type of \"Inputs\" is selected, choose the pre-"
"existing Inputs which should be associated with the Catalog Item"
msgstr "Assurez-vous que les deux ports physiques sont disponibles et correctement mappés."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:58
msgid "Using Forms with Catalog Items"
msgstr "Le bonding fournit l'agrégation de bande passante et la redondance."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:62
msgid ""
"Using Forms provides a number of advantages over using Inputs. Once the "
"Form is selected, |morpheus| helpfully provides a sidebar which contains "
"all variables that can be consumed in the Instance config from the Form:"
msgstr "Interfaces réseau virtuelles"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:64
msgid ".. image:: /images/forms/catalogSidebar.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:66
msgid ""
"Many Form Inputs are designed to auto-inject themselves into the Instance"
" config, you can see in the screenshot above that \"AUTO INJECT\" is "
"checked. For variables that auto-inject, you do not need to override any "
"static configuration with a variable call in order to consume that form "
"value. In most cases, you should leave auto-inject turned on but the "
"option is available to disable it for more advanced situations such as if"
" you wanted to code custom logic into the variable call."
msgstr "Vérifiez si les réseaux étiquetés nécessitent une interface IP."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:68
msgid ""
"Other types of Form Inputs do not auto-inject and, for these, you must "
"override any static configuration in the Instance config with a variable "
"call. For these situations, |morpheus| helpfully provides the results of "
"all variables so you can be sure you're injecting the proper call. Click "
"on the question mark (?) button immediately to the right of the \"FORM "
"VARIABLES\" header to see a list of available variables and an example "
"resolved variable. Variable tiles may be dragged from the sidebar into "
"the CONFIG text area and a properly-formatted variable call will be "
"inserted."
msgstr "Si ce n'est pas nécessaire, ne configurez pas l'interface virtuelle."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:70
msgid ".. image:: /images/forms/optionTypeHelp.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:72
msgid ""
"As an example, see the configuration for an Ubuntu server in the "
"expandable section below. You'll notice in the configuration that a "
"VMware Cloud, a specific Group, a specific Plan, and other static "
"configurations are set. Since the Group, Cloud, Plan and other variables "
"are able to be automatically injected, the user may select a different "
"Group, Cloud, Plan, etc. from the form at provision time. The creator of "
"the Catalog Item does not need to override those static configurations "
"with variable calls."
msgstr "Cette rubrique décrit les procédures de dépannage pour le stockage."

